<title>FRANCE: Latest details of EU grain export/import balance.</title>
<headline>Latest details of EU grain export/import balance.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are details of EU grain export/import commitments as of January 7 in the July-to-June 1996/97 campaign, supplied by member country officials.</p>
<p>On January 9, the EU additionally granted exports of 260,000 tonnes of soft wheat, 178,273 tonnes of barley, 14,092 tonnes of rye, 33,000 tonnes of oats, and 19,800 tonnes of durum wheat.</p>
<p>Figures ('000 tonnes) are based on officially communicated certificates and are subject to revision.</p>
